{"unit_id":"chillBnetley__dsh-model-router#card-zh","repo":"chillBnetley/dsh-model-router","commit":"fd344a34263d944d01a773606114469294b0e417","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-router 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型路由插件：它挂接 llm/stream，根据当前用户问题的类型、难度、工具需求和模型能力矩阵选择提供方与模型。研究和编码任务优先考虑能力评分，日常闲聊可优先免费模型；候选不可用时按配置回退。它还提供按会话切换的工作/闲聊模式、路由决策查看与统计命令，以及仅作用于闲聊轮次的提示语气控制。适合希望按任务类型分配模型并查看选择原因的 DSH 用户。启用后可配置 DeepSeek 默认回退模型；插件本身未要求固定 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:391-435","index.js:444-470","lib/client.js:67-90","lib/chitchat-style.mjs:48-80","cordis.patch.yml:13-17"]}
{"unit_id":"chillBnetley__dsh-model-router#card-en","repo":"chillBnetley/dsh-model-router","commit":"fd344a34263d944d01a773606114469294b0e417","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-router routes DSH Web requests by task type. It hooks llm/stream and selects models using request type, tool needs, and capability ratings. Research can favor quality; casual chat can prefer free models. It adds per-session work/chat modes, route inspection, and casual-only prompt styling.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:391-435","index.js:444-470","lib/client.js:67-90","lib/chitchat-style.mjs:48-80","cordis.patch.yml:13-17"]}
