{"unit_id":"chillBnetley__dsh-model-router#feature-task-routing","repo":"chillBnetley/dsh-model-router","commit":"fd344a34263d944d01a773606114469294b0e417","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-router 的功能「task-routing」：按请求类型选模型：分类器识别用户轮次类型，策略结合能力评分、工具需求与候选可用性决定路由；候选池为空时使用配置的回退，或保留原请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/classify.mjs:450-505","lib/policy.mjs:252-350"]}
{"unit_id":"chillBnetley__dsh-model-router#feature-session-mode","repo":"chillBnetley/dsh-model-router","commit":"fd344a34263d944d01a773606114469294b0e417","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-router 的功能「session-mode」：工作/闲聊模式：用户可用 /mode work|chat 命令切换当前会话策略，模式写入本地状态文件与会话事件；Web 输入区也提供切换按钮。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:444-470","lib/client.js:57-86"]}
{"unit_id":"chillBnetley__dsh-model-router#feature-route-inspection","repo":"chillBnetley/dsh-model-router","commit":"fd344a34263d944d01a773606114469294b0e417","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-router 的功能「route-inspection」：路由诊断：/route 显示最近一次分类、模式、请求与选中模型、选择原因、候选数量和冷却状态；/route-stats 汇总决策情况。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:410-443"]}
{"unit_id":"chillBnetley__dsh-model-router#feature-chitchat-style","repo":"chillBnetley/dsh-model-router","commit":"fd344a34263d944d01a773606114469294b0e417","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-router 的功能「chitchat-style」：闲聊提示控制：系统提示仅在分类为日常闲聊且不需要工具时加入简短口语化指令，可在配置中关闭或覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/chitchat-style.mjs:48-80"]}
